00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:19.613 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Certaines salles de spectacle

00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:26.019 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ne semblent pas non plus

00:01:15.442 --> 00:01:27.020 size:53% position:73% line:53%
