00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:49.075 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des restaurateurs new-yorkais.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:50.076 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ici aussi, la rareté de la main-

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:51.311 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'oeuvre donne des sueurs

00:01:49.376 --> 00:01:52.812 size:53% position:73% line:53%
